Package: dar
Title: Differential Abundance Workflows for Microbiome Data
Version: 1.9.12
Date: 2026-08-04
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Francesc",
             family = "Catala-Moll",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "fcatala@irsicaixa.es",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2354-8648"))
    )
Description: Provides a recipe-based interface for differential abundance
    analysis of microbiome data. A shared model specification defines
    covariates, contrasts, reference levels and taxonomic aggregation, with
    compatibility checks for each method. Pipeable workflows combine
    preprocessing, quality control and multiple differential abundance methods.
    Results can be inspected in a common format that preserves method-specific
    effect scales, visualized and compared. Recipes can be exported and imported
    using a versioned, non-executable format. Optional consensus rules summarize
    agreement across methods for each contrast and effect direction.
